{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"farmhouse_t1","model_identifier":"farmhouse_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# farmhouse_t1\n\nFarmhouse tier 1: a low thatched cottage of wattle and daub on a stone footing, where workers shelter at night.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 5 columns (96 x 80 units, 2.70 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -56..36, y 0..110, z -44..44 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 54, construction_0 26, construction_33 31, construction_66 50, ruined 26 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 98 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `farmhouse_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `farmhouse_t1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_farmhouse_t1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -45)\n- `fx_smoke` at (18, 111, 22)\n\n## Notes\n\n- The thatched eaves are low (51 u); the door rises through a dormer-like daub head to 80 u.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"h_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,0.0,-38.0],"to":[34.0,3.0,38.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[140.0,297.0,208.0,300.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,294.0,76.0,297.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[140.0,297.0,208.0,300.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,294.0,76.0,297.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[109.0,120.0,177.0,196.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[109.0,120.0,177.0,196.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fbb18d13-fdff-5ca4-bca4-973798e49adf"},{"name":"h_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,-36.0],"to":[32.0,51.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,208.0,64.0,256.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[82.0,208.0,86.0,256.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,208.0,64.0,256.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[82.0,208.0,86.0,256.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,266.0,64.0,270.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,266.0,64.0,270.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"682688bb-3db9-542e-86c6-b5146f5b511c"},{"name":"h_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,32.0],"to":[32.0,51.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,208.0,64.0,256.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[86.0,208.0,90.0,256.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,208.0,64.0,256.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[86.0,208.0,90.0,256.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[64.0,266.0,128.0,270.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[64.0,266.0,128.0,270.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1665063a-fdd9-5a91-b36d-4227071cb091"},{"name":"h_w0_w","box_uv":false